2. take $$$1$$$ card from the top of $$$p$$$ and move it to $$$p'$$$: $$$p$$$ becomes empty, $$$p'$$$ becomes $$$[5, 2, 4, 3, 1]$$$;

In the third test case, one of the optimal strategies is:

